OL,3,GNEWSAOffshore wind farm approved for
OL,4,Asite off Peterhead
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Scottish government has approved
OL,7,Fplans for a 67-turbine floating
OL,8,Foffshore wind farm at a site about 39
OL,9,Fmiles (63km) from Peterhead in
OL,10,FAberdeenshire.
OL,12,FDeveloper Fred Olsen Seawind said its
OL,13,F1GW Muir Mhor project could generate
OL,14,Fenough electricity annually for more
OL,15,Fthan a million homes.
OL,17,FGeneration could start in the early
OL,18,F2030s.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
