OL,3,GNEWSAOffshore wind farm approved for
OL,4,Asite off Peterhead
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Scottish government said its
OL,7,Fconsent came with a number of
OL,8,Fconditions, including a requirement for
OL,9,Fmeasures to reduce potential impacts on
OL,10,Ffishing and seabirds.
